{"$schema":"https://json.schemastore.org/sarif-2.1.0.json","runs":[{"artifacts":[{"contents":{"text":"<scxml xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2005/07/scxml\" version=\"1.0\" datamodel=\"xpath\" initial=\"s\">\n  <datamodel><data id=\"x\"/></datamodel>\n  <state id=\"s\">\n    <onentry><assign location=\"$x\" expr=\"1\"><item/></assign></onentry>\n    <transition event=\"go\" target=\"done\"/>\n  </state>\n  <final id=\"done\"/>\n</scxml>\n"},"location":{"uri":"tests/ui/scxml053-assign-expr-and-element-child.scxml"},"mimeType":"application/scxml+xml"}],"columnKind":"utf16CodeUnits","properties":{"diagnosticCounts":{"errors":1,"notes":0,"total":1,"warnings":0},"producer":{"kind":"validator"}},"results":[{"fixes":[{"artifactChanges":[{"artifactLocation":{"uri":"tests/ui/scxml053-assign-expr-and-element-child.scxml"},"replacements":[{"deletedRegion":{"byteLength":9,"byteOffset":183,"endColumn":44,"endLine":4,"startColumn":35,"startLine":4},"insertedContent":{"text":""}}]}],"description":{"text":"remove `expr`"},"properties":{"applicability":"maybe-incorrect"}}],"level":"error","locations":[{"physicalLocation":{"artifactLocation":{"uri":"tests/ui/scxml053-assign-expr-and-element-child.scxml"},"region":{"endColumn":52,"endLine":4,"startColumn":45,"startLine":4}}}],"message":{"markdown":"`<assign>` declares more than one value source: `expr` and the child content\n\n**Note:** `<assign>` takes the value it stores from exactly one of `expr` or inline child content; with both the value is ambiguous\n\n**Help:** keep one value source: remove `expr`, or remove the child content\n\n**Spec:** SCXML 1.0 §5.4 <assign>","text":"`<assign>` declares more than one value source: `expr` and the child content"},"properties":{"byteSpan":{"end":200,"start":193},"category":"semantic"},"relatedLocations":[{"id":1,"message":{"text":"`expr` is declared here"},"physicalLocation":{"artifactLocation":{"uri":"tests/ui/scxml053-assign-expr-and-element-child.scxml"},"region":{"endColumn":44,"endLine":4,"startColumn":36,"startLine":4}}}],"ruleId":"SCXML053"}],"tool":{"driver":{"informationUri":"https://www.w3.org/TR/scxml/","name":"scxml-validator","rules":[{"defaultConfiguration":{"level":"error"},"fullDescription":{"text":"`<data>` takes its value from exactly one of `src`, `expr`, or child content (SCXML 1.0 §5.3), `<content>` is either computed by `expr` or given as child content (§5.6), and `<assign>` takes its value from `expr` or child content (§5.4); with several sources the value is ambiguous"},"help":{"text":"How to fix: keep one value source and remove the others.\n\nSpecification: SCXML 1.0 §5.3 <data>\n\nRun `scxml-cli --explain SCXML053` for examples."},"helpUri":"https://www.w3.org/TR/scxml/#data","id":"SCXML053","name":"SCXML053","properties":{"category":"semantic"},"shortDescription":{"text":"a `<data>`, `<content>`, or `<assign>` has more than one value source"}}],"semanticVersion":"0.2.0"}}}],"version":"2.1.0"}